# migration-destructive.list — destructive-statement template for check-migration-guard.
# gate-sdk/SPEC.md §check-migration-guard. One POSIX ERE per line; '#' comments and
# blank lines are ignored. Copy to your gates dir as migration-destructive.list and
# point GATE_SDK_MIGRATION_DIR at your migration directory. An ERE matches a
# statement with its comments and quoted strings stripped, each whitespace run read
# as one space, and upper-cased. A deliberate destructive statement takes
# '-- migration-ok: <reason>' on one of its lines.
DROP (TABLE|INDEX|VIEW|TRIGGER)
ALTER TABLE .* DROP
ALTER TABLE .* RENAME
